  "Nuevos mercados.": "New markets.",
  "Conexiones reales.": "Real connections.",
  "Acompañamos a empresas, emprendedores e instituciones a cruzar fronteras con un propósito.": "We support businesses, entrepreneurs and institutions in crossing borders with a purpose.",
  "Escena ilustrativa de viajeros de negocios conversando en un aeropuerto": "Illustrative scene of business travelers talking at an airport",
